      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW UNITY (7) held her own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only 1.75 lengths (26.10) behind Kiwi Eddie at this track. Key chance in this line up. TINKER SPOT (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (22.57) at this track in T3 RSTW over 390m. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. BAMBI'S PRIDE (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.74) at this track behind Paw Zillie in a T3 Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Hard to beat again. ZORBAY (8) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
